%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: IvanDay1Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Oh! A new face! Ha! First day, yes? I can always tell. There is a freshness
      about you. Very wide eyes. I love wide eyes!
    animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Ivan Tarkov. Factory worker. Third residential block. I pass through
      here every evening, same time, same smile. Reliable as a clock!
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: The officer before you was very observant. Very sharp. Very dedicated
      to her work. Then one day she simply... stopped showing up. These things happen,
      I suppose!
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: Tell me, do you enjoy meeting people in this line of work? I think it
      is the very best part!
    animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: It's part of the job.
      npcResponse: Of course! Give it time, though. You will find every face becomes
        memorable. Some more than others. Naturally.
      animationTrigger: TalkCocky
    - playerChoiceText: People are interesting.
      npcResponse: "Yes! Exactly! And the most interesting part \u2014 they rarely
        notice when someone is paying very close attention. Ha!"
      animationTrigger: TalkSmile
  - type: 0
    npcLine: You should smile more, officer. I have found that a smile makes even
      the most guarded person feel completely at ease. It is a wonderful, wonderful
      tool.
    animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: But you have work to do, and I do not want to keep you. Here are my
      papers. Everything is in order, as always. I am a very tidy person.
    animationTrigger: TalkPoint
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
